  "bio": "Jasper Van Gestel, based in Antwerp, Belgium, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in illustrative and traditional styles. Known for his professionalism and neatness, he manages a cleanly work environment, assuring customers of both quality tattoos and hygienic conditions. To contact Jasper for bookings, one can simply drop him a direct message on his Instagram handle, @braboshandtattoo.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Antwerp, Flanders, Belgium"
}